    "detailed_description": "Welcome to &quot;Keep Up.&quot; In this action game, you will control a small dog with various jumping skills. Keep going up and find the path to the top.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/026ff3ade6ca90edcf251c1af2df733a.poster.avif?t=1732104203\" width=640 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/026ff3ade6ca90edcf251c1af2df733a.webm?t=1732104203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/026ff3ade6ca90edcf251c1af2df733a.mp4?t=1732104203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>(Healthy Dog Warm Reminder: The visuals of this game may cause discomfort for players with conditions such as photosensitive epilepsy.)<br><br>As this is the first game on Steam, it's said that more content is better, so currently, we have included an arena mode, and the dungeon mode is still in development.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/a4aff1e0cb1c587c6b786f2873b4f7f8.poster.avif?t=1732104203\" width=640 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/a4aff1e0cb1c587c6b786f2873b4f7f8.webm?t=1732104203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/a4aff1e0cb1c587c6b786f2873b4f7f8.mp4?t=1732104203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Game Features:<br><br>You don't necessarily have to use regular attacks when encountering enemies: unique combat system where actions like jumping and dashing also deal damage (Arena Mode).<br>Highly personalized original art style and music.<br>The entire game was basically developed by one person.<br>Play with at least 3 dogs together.<br>A saveable home simulator.<br>Uh... actually, there are 6 dogs?<br>There's a girl to keep you company on your journey; try chatting with her to avoid only having Q&amp;A with a machine.<br>The girl is the type I like, but please don't romance her.<br>I'm still working on the character's story...<br>If you decide to play this game, could you help me count the dogs...? I'm not very good at counting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/f3cf5001547e439e7f022dc6b53188cb.poster.avif?t=1732104203\" width=640 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/f3cf5001547e439e7f022dc6b53188cb.webm?t=1732104203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/f3cf5001547e439e7f022dc6b53188cb.mp4?t=1732104203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to &quot;Keep Up.&quot; In this action game, you will control a small dog with various jumping skills. Keep going up and find the path to the top.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/026ff3ade6ca90edcf251c1af2df733a.poster.avif?t=1732104203\" width=640 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/026ff3ade6ca90edcf251c1af2df733a.webm?t=1732104203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/026ff3ade6ca90edcf251c1af2df733a.mp4?t=1732104203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>(Healthy Dog Warm Reminder: The visuals of this game may cause discomfort for players with conditions such as photosensitive epilepsy.)<br><br>As this is the first game on Steam, it's said that more content is better, so currently, we have included an arena mode, and the dungeon mode is still in development.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/a4aff1e0cb1c587c6b786f2873b4f7f8.poster.avif?t=1732104203\" width=640 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/a4aff1e0cb1c587c6b786f2873b4f7f8.webm?t=1732104203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/a4aff1e0cb1c587c6b786f2873b4f7f8.mp4?t=1732104203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Game Features:<br><br>You don't necessarily have to use regular attacks when encountering enemies: unique combat system where actions like jumping and dashing also deal damage (Arena Mode).<br>Highly personalized original art style and music.<br>The entire game was basically developed by one person.<br>Play with at least 3 dogs together.<br>A saveable home simulator.<br>Uh... actually, there are 6 dogs?<br>There's a girl to keep you company on your journey; try chatting with her to avoid only having Q&amp;A with a machine.<br>The girl is the type I like, but please don't romance her.<br>I'm still working on the character's story...<br>If you decide to play this game, could you help me count the dogs...? I'm not very good at counting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/f3cf5001547e439e7f022dc6b53188cb.poster.avif?t=1732104203\" width=640 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/f3cf5001547e439e7f022dc6b53188cb.webm?t=1732104203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912030/extras/f3cf5001547e439e7f022dc6b53188cb.mp4?t=1732104203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>",
